    "title": "4 victims, no murder trial date: Wednesday marks 1 year since Lake County quadruple homicide - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashlyn Swinea ,\n5 hours ago JACKSON, Tenn. (WBBJ) - One year ago today, four lives were lost in Lake County. Austin Drummond is accused of the quadruple homicide. “There can’t be any more tragedy in a family, or anything more tragic, to happen to a person than the loss of a family member. Unfortunately, we have in this case a family who has lost multiple people,” said Danny Goodman, the 29th District Attorney. Read full article\n3",
